        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "433095",
          "text": "<p>Consider the list:</p><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">l = ['a', 'b', 'c', 'd', 'e', 'f']</pre><p>What will be the output of the following expression?</p><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">l[-2:-6:-1]</pre><ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\"><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">['e', 'd', 'c', 'b']</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">['e', 'd', 'c']</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">['f', 'e', 'd']\n</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">['e', 'd']</pre></li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "a",
          "award": 2,
          "penalty": "0.6666",
          "tags": "goclasses2025-python-2,goclasses,python-programming,programming,two-marks",
          "category": "Programming in Python"
        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "433097",
          "text": "<p>What will be the output of the following Python code?</p><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">lst1 = [[1, 5], [5, 10]]\nlst2 = [[1, 5], [999, 999]]\nprint(lst1 &gt; lst2)</pre><ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\"><li>True</li><li>False</li><li>It will print a random boolean value since the comparison of lists is not deterministic</li><li>SyntaxError, because list comparison with nested lists is not syntactically valid in Python.</li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "b",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "tags": "goclasses2025-python-2,goclasses,python-programming,programming,one-mark",
          "category": "Programming in Python"
        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "433105",
          "text": "<p>Given the list:</p><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">l = ['a', 'b', 'c', 'd', 'e', 'f']</pre><p>What will be the output for the below expression ?</p><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">l[::2]</pre><ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\"><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">['a', 'c', 'e']</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">['b', 'd', 'f']</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">['a', 'b', 'c', 'd', 'e', 'f']</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">['c', 'e', 'f']</pre><p> </p></li></ol>",
