        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "433101",
          "text": "<p>Consider the following Python code:</p><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">my_tuple = (\"Python\", \"cobra\")\nmy_tuple += (\"boa\", \"anaconda\")\n\nprint(my_tuple)\n</pre><p><br>What will be the output of running this code?<br> </p><ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\"><li>An error will occur.</li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"2\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">('Python', 'cobra', 'boa', 'anaconda')</pre></li><li>SyntaxError</li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\"> ('Python', 'cobraboa', 'anaconda')</pre><p> </p></li></ol>",
