        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "433102",
          "text": "<p>Consider the following Python code:</p><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">silly_tuple = ([\"one\", \"two\"], [\"three\"])\nsilly_tuple[1] += [\"four\"]\n\nprint(silly_tuple)\n</pre><p><br>What will be the result of running this code?</p><ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\"><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">(['one', 'two'], ['four'])</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">(['one', 'two', 'three'], ['four'])</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">(['one', 'two'], ['three', 'four'])</pre></li><li>An error will occur.</li></ol>",
