        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "433091",
          "text": "<p>Which of the following code snippets will print the output $(20,30,40) ?$<br> </p><ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\"><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">a, b, c = [20, 30, 40]\nprint((a, b, c))</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">a, *rest = [20, 30, 40]\nprint(rest)</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">def fun(*numbers):\n    print(numbers)\nfun(20, 30, 40)</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">def fun(a, *numbers):\n    print(numbers)\nfun(10, 20, 30, 40)</pre><p> </p></li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Select",
          "answer": "a;c;d",
          "award": 2,
          "penalty": "0.0000",
          "tags": "goclasses2025-python-2,goclasses,python-programming,programming,multiple-selects,two-marks",
          "category": "Programming in Python"
        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "433099",
          "text": "<p>What will be the output of the following Python code?<br> </p><pre data-pbcklang=\"python\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-python\">numbers = [1, 2, 3]\nintegers = numbers\nnumbers[:] = numbers + [4, 5, 6]\nprint(integers)\n</pre><ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\"><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">[1, 2, 3]</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">[4, 5, 6]</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]</pre></li><li><pre data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"4\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">[ ]</pre><p> </p></li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "c",
